## Title: Furniture Finder Lite
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 1.0.1
## AddOnVersion: 10001
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: Adds where a furnishing comes from to its tooltip: merchant, location, price, required achievement, event, plan. A light take on Furniture Finder by @Aldimar77, on the Furniture Catalogue database by wookiefriseur, manavortex and contributors, packed to use a fraction of the memory. Gamepad UI.
## SavedVariables: FurnitureFinderLiteSavedVars
## OptionalDependsOn: LibConsoleLogger FurnitureFinder
